# ---- firmware (PlatformIO) ----
# .pio holds build output AND every downloaded library and toolchain package.
# It is large, machine-specific, and fully reproducible from platformio.ini.
firmware/.pio/
firmware/.vscode/
firmware/dependencies.lock

# ---- Android ----
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/.idea/
android/.kotlin/
# Machine-specific SDK path.
android/local.properties
*.apk
*.aab

# gradle-wrapper.jar IS committed on purpose: it makes the build reproducible
# without a system Gradle install, which is the standard for Android projects.

# ---- Secrets ----
# android/gradle.properties is tracked, but as a TEMPLATE with empty key
# values. Put real keys in ~/.gradle/gradle.properties, which Gradle reads for
# every project and which lives outside any repo:
#
#   MAPTILER_KEY=...
#   GRAPHHOPPER_KEY=...
#
# Never fill the values in the tracked file - once pushed, a key is in the
# history for good.

# ---- Editors / OS ----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
